    show yuri zorder 2 at t33
    show monika 1n zorder 3 at f32
    m "口、口头禅吗？"
    m "我没有口头禅啊......"
    show monika zorder 2 at t32
    show natsuki 4q zorder 3 at f31
    n "见鬼了......"
